  <explanation>
    <key>en</key>
    <value>Data is required to indicate whether the bank is connected to the provider. IDs are used to fill requests to the provider</value>
  </explanation>
  <explanation>
    <key>fa</key>
    <value>داده‌ها برای نشان‌دادن اتصال بانک به ارائه‌دهنده لازم هستند. شناسه‌ها برای تکمیل درخواست‌ها به ارائه‌دهنده استفاده می‌شوند</value>
  </explanation>
  <explanation>
    <key>ru</key>
    <value>Данные необходимы для определения, что банк подключен к провайдеру, идентификаторы будут использоваться для заполнения запросов провайдеру</value>
  </explanation>
  <explanation>
    <key>tr</key>
    <value>Veriler, bankanın sağlayıcıya bağlı olduğunu belirlemek için gereklidir, kimlikler ise sağlayıcıya yönelik talepleri doldurmak için kullanılacaktır</value>
  </explanation>
  <explanation>
    <key>vi</key>
    <value>Dữ liệu cần thiết để xác định là ngân hàng đã kết nối với provider, ID sẽ được dùng để điền truy vấn cho provider</value>
  </explanation>
  <explanation>
    <key>it</key>
    <value>Data is required to indicate whether the bank is connected to the provider. IDs are used to fill requests to the provider</value>
  </explanation>
  <explanation>
    <key>pl</key>
    <value>Data is required to indicate whether the bank is connected to the provider. IDs are used to fill requests to the provider</value>
  </explanation>
